The GNU C Library's startup code and libc_nonshared objects, as Zig 0.15.2
builds them from the glibc sources it bundles for a glibc 2.17 target, and
links them statically into freedom-ipfsd's Linux binaries (x86_64 and
aarch64):

- Scrt1.o, from sysdeps/x86_64/start.S (Copyright (C) 2001-2025) and
  sysdeps/aarch64/start.S (Copyright (C) 1995-2025);
- __libc_csu_init and __libc_csu_fini, from csu/elf-init-2.33.c
  (Copyright (C) 2002-2020);
- stat64, fstat64 and lstat64, from io/stat64-2.32.c, io/fstat64-2.32.c and
  io/lstat64-2.32.c (Copyright (C) 1996-2020);
- __pthread_atfork (aarch64), from sysdeps/pthread/pthread_atfork.c
  (Copyright (C) 2002-2021).

